### 1. Create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/section
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "nameUz": "Yangiliklar",
  "nameRu": "Новости",
  "nameEn": "News",
  "sectionKey": "news"
}

### 2. Get all
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/section

### 3. Get by language
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/section/lang
Accept-Language: UZ

### 4. Update
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/section/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "nameUz": "Yangiliklar",
  "nameRu": "Новости",
  "nameEn": "News",
  "sectionKey": "news"
}

### 5. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/v1/section/1